  "content": "<h1>女仆餐厅</h1>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>《东方女仆》的一个附加模组，使女仆能够自动烹饪和上菜。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>![Minecraft](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fbadge%252fMinecraft-Java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://img.shields.io/badge/Minecraft-Java</a> Edition-brightgreen) ![Forge](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fbadge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://img.shields.io/badge/</a> Forge | NeoForge  -1.20.1 | 1.21.1-orange) ![License](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fbadge%252fLicense-BSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://img.shields.io/badge/License-BSD</a> -blue)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/RTiyYo0U/images/af8ed07134840c6b8c169185f185101bbbf50825.png\" alt=\"alt text\"></p>\n<h2>简介</h2>\n<p>这是一个为《我的世界》Java版开发的模组。该模组致力于通过女仆们的团队协作，提供类似餐厅的自动化体验。</p>\n<h2>功能特性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>女仆在烹饪和上菜方面的团队协作。</li>\n<li>支持的模组：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kaleidoscope-cookery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">万花筒烹饪</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">丰收季节</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bakeries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">面包店</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>许可协议</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/MasterMarisa/MaidRestaurant/blob/main/LICENSE.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BSD 3-Clause 许可证</a></p>\n<h2>反馈与建议</h2>\n<p>如果您在使用过程中遇到问题或有改进建议，请通过以下方式联系我们：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>🐛 <a href=\"https://github.com/MasterMarisa/MaidRestaurant/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题追踪</a> - 提交错误报告</li>\n<li>💡 <a href=\"https://github.com/MasterMarisa/MaidRestaurant/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题追踪</a> - 功能建议、讨论与交流</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>开发者</h2>\n<p><strong>KomeijiMarisa</strong></p>",
